(*---
description: Explores init operator and next case with check no_deadlock_check.
ref: tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getInitStates; tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getNextStates
features:
  - state-space
outcome: any
config: |
  INIT Init
  NEXT Next
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE space_operator__case__no_deadlock_check ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == Assign(0, 0)
Next == CASE TRUE -> x' = x /\ y' = y [] OTHER -> FALSE

====

